WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.800
Here's the easiest upgrade

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.760
for your videos

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.200
and it costs nothing.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.480
Face a window.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.240
Don't put the window behind you

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.520
because that turns you

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.640
into a shadow.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.240
Turn around so the daylight

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.480
lands on your face.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.880
Then take one step back

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.760
so it's nice and soft.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.680
Morning or late afternoon light

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:18.720
works best.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.320
Try it on your next video

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.400
and you'll see the difference

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.320
straight away.
